{{!
    @template theme_brandable/editor_cloudproposal

    Banner of the version of the project proposed to this environment from another one (spec C15): who, when, the
    message, and the changes from the version published here, pull or dismiss.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * number, note - Version proposed; from - environment it comes from
    * author, message, createdat - The proposal

    Example context (json):
    {
        "id": "5d0f", "versionid": "9c2d", "number": 12, "note": "Barre de navigation bleu foncé.",
        "from": "Préproduction", "author": "Paul Durand", "message": "À valider avant la rentrée",
        "createdat": 1793849945
    }
}}
<div class="tbe-jsreview-title">
    <strong>{{#str}} cloud:proposal:banner, theme_brandable, { "number": {{number}}, "from": {{#quote}}{{from}}{{/quote}} } {{/str}}</strong>
    <span class="tbe-hint">{{#author}}{{#str}} cloud:proposal:by, theme_brandable, {{author}} {{/str}} · {{/author}}{{#userdate}} {{createdat}}, {{#str}} strftimedatetimeshort, core_langconfig {{/str}} {{/userdate}}</span>
</div>
{{#note}}<div class="tbe-version-note">{{note}}</div>{{/note}}
{{#message}}<blockquote class="tbe-version-note mb-1">{{message}}</blockquote>{{/message}}
<div class="tbe-jsconsent-actions">
    <button type="button" class="tbe-link" data-action="cloudproposalchanges">{{#str}} cloud:proposal:changes, theme_brandable {{/str}}</button>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm tbe-btn-accent" data-action="cloudpull">{{#str}} cloud:proposal:pull, theme_brandable {{/str}}</button>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-secondary" data-action="clouddismiss">{{#str}} cloud:proposal:dismiss, theme_brandable {{/str}}</button>
</div>
